[TITLE]
IO-15: a [GROUNDWATER] row with only the 10 required fields
(Subcat Aquifer Node Esurf A1 B1 A2 B2 A3 Dsw). The optional Egwt, Ebot, Egw
and Umc are left out, as the input reference allows. 10-acre aquifer with the
water table at 8 ft draining to J1 (invert 2 ft), no rain, 1 day.

